lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-04-16T18:54:16Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T23:06:26Z","closed_at":"2025-07-01T23:04:09Z","assignee":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.3.stable and 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nAndroid 15 - Pixel 9 - Compatibility \n\n### Issue description\n\nThe width of safe area returned by DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area()  is too narrow on Pixel 9 in some orientations:\n\nIn the screenshots below you can see the grey area outside the safe area is twice as big as it should be when the top camera is on the right or bottom\n\nToo narrow:\nLandscape - camera on the right:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/181b3065-95c3-4e21-a6d1-8798a5a93822)\n\nToo short:\nPortrait - camera on the bottom:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b587e2a0-de3d-4438-bcfd-a6b3a51e65cb)\n\nCorrect:\nLandscape - camera on left:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55b371ee-c999-4529-84e5-8fe20f0de98a)\n\nPortrait - camera on top:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c822fbdd-545f-4c29-a1ad-b73e428ae729)\n\n\nThe problem did not reproduce on:\nPixel 6a - Android 16\nGalaxy A10e - Android 11\n\nI believe the problem is in GodotIO.java getDisplaySafeArea\ngetWindowVisibleDisplayFrame already has the insets removed in some cases, so it should use getWindowVisibleDisplayFrame or getRootWindowInsets but not both at the same time. \n\nHere is my version of getDisplaySafeArea that works on these 3 phones correctly.  I'm not sure if using decorView.getX, getY, getWidth, getHeight  is the best way to get the size or not though.\n\n```java\t\n\tpublic int[] getDisplaySafeArea() {\n\t\tRect rect = new Rect();\n\t\tactivity.getWindow().getDecorView().getWindowVisibleDisplayFrame(rect);\n\n\t\tint[] result = { rect.left, rect.top, rect.right, rect.bottom };\n\t\tif (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.P) {\n\t\t\tView decorView = activity.getWindow().getDecorView();\n\t\t\tresult[0] = (int) decorView.getX();\n\t\t\tresult[1] = (int) decorView.getY();\n\t\t\tresult[2] = decorView.getWidth();\n\t\t\tresult[3] = decorView.getHeight();\n\t\t\tWindowInsets insets = activity.getWindow().getDecorView().getRootWindowInsets();\n\t\t\tDisplayCutout cutout = insets.getDisplayCutout();\n\t\t\tif (cutout != null) {\n\t\t\t\tint insetLeft = cutout.getSafeInsetLeft();\n\t\t\t\tint insetTop = cutout.getSafeInsetTop();\n\t\t\t\tresult[0] = insetLeft;\n\t\t\t\tresult[1] = insetTop;\n\t\t\t\tresult[2] -= insetLeft + cutout.getSafeInsetRight();\n\t\t\t\tresult[3] -= insetTop + cutout.getSafeInsetBottom();\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn result;\n\t}\n```\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee attached project, but basically:\n \n1. Create new project\n2. Set orientation in project settings to sensor\n3. Call DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area()  while holding phone in different orientations\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[safe-area-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19782364/safe-area-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105462/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105462/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}